!!omap
  - id: F009
  - function: MainMenu
  - range:
      - 146
      - 185
  - args: []
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void MainMenu()\n{\n  UserPtr UserList = NULL;\n  RoomPtr RoomList = NULL;\n\
      \  ReservationPtr ReservationList = NULL;\n\n  int Choice = 0;\n  do\n  {\n\
      \    system(\"cls\");\n    printf(\"\\n\\n=============================================\\\
      n\");\n    printf(\"\\t\\tMain Menu\");\n    printf(\"\\n=============================================\\\
      n\");\n    printf(\"  [1] User Management Menu.\");\n    printf(\"\\n  [2] Room
      Management Menu.\");\n    printf(\"\\n  [3] Reservation Management Menu.\");\n\
      \    printf(\"\\n  [4] Exit.\");\n    printf(\"\\n=============================================\\\
      n\");\n    printf(\" - Please enter your choice: \");\n    Choice = ReadIntBetween(1,
      4);\n    switch (Choice)\n    {\n    case 1:\n      UserManagementMenu(&UserList);\n\
      \      break;\n    case 2:\n      RoomManagementMenu(&RoomList);\n      break;\n\
      \    case 3:\n      ReservationManagementMenu(&ReservationList, UserList, &RoomList);\n\
      \      break;\n    case 4:\n      ExitScreen();\n      break;\n    default:\n\
      \      printf(\"\\nError!\");\n      break;\n    }\n  } while (Choice != 4);\n\
      }\n"
  - description: 
      この関数は、ユーザー、部屋、予約の管理メニューを選択できるメインメニューを表示し、ユーザーの選択に応じてそれぞれの管理メニューを呼び出す機能を提供します。選択肢にはユーザー管理、部屋管理、予約管理、およびプログラムの終了が含まれ、ユーザーが終了を選択するまでループします。
